7:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","$L4",null,{"label":"Ownership","title":"Designed, implemented,","accent":"integrated","sub":"What I did on each side of the project — kept separate, because they are different kinds of work. AI tools accelerated implementation; understanding the code, reviewing the output, integrating it and validating it stayed with me."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4","children":[["$","$L5","designed",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I designed"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"items":["The visual system — an editorial paper-and-ink palette, a display grotesque with a mono annotation layer, and one section rhythm used everywhere.","Long-form case studies with a contents rail, and five scroll-driven figures that explain the practice — how design, engineering and AI combine, how an interface is assembled, an AI product loop, how a problem gets ordered, and the method as one machine."]}]]}],["$","$L5","implemented",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I implemented"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"items":["Feature-folder architecture: each case study owns its components and content; shared case-study primitives sit in one place.","Every fact — dates, metrics, contact details, projects — read from two typed content modules, so nothing is duplicated.","Motion that honours the reduced-motion preference everywhere: pinned, scroll-driven figures fall back to a static, fully written-out sequence on phones and under reduced motion — and GSAP is never downloaded there.","A contents rail that builds itself from the headings on the page, so a new section is indexed without being registered."]}]]}],["$","$L5","integrated",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"What I integrated"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"items":["Static generation for every route, metadata, sitemap and schema.org JSON-LD, deployed on Vercel."]}]]}],["$","$L5","aiAssisted",{"className":"p-5 md:p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink","children":"Where AI assisted"}],["$","$Ld",null,{"items":["Claude is used as a coding partner — for audits, refactors and first drafts — with every change reviewed, built and checked in the browser before it ships."]}]]}]]}]]}]
